  "details": "The title probably doesn't explain all too well, but what if there was an addition to your individual avatar menus, that pretty much showed exactly how long in total you have played that said avatar. So really, if you wanted to play a different model you had in your personal avatar list, you can see how long you have played as that model by choosing said model, and then somewhere a time stamp will show how long you have played said model for the total time you have played it ever. Best example is how Steam shows how long you play every game. I know this feature sounds almost pointless, but I have always thought it would be a neat idea for the game.",
